---
// The website's privacy policy: Jason's text of Nov 11, 2026, word for word, with three additions he was told about:
// the 10-business-day / any-reasonable-way opt-out sentence in section 5 (FCC rules; checked by scripts/site-check/tcpa.cjs),
// the Manage cookies link in section 6, and the phone number in section 13.
// Ylopo's own policy stays at /privacy/ylopo.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = 'November 11, 2026';
const EMAIL = 'jason@hhgus.com';
---
<Base breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy' }]} title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`}
  description={`What ${site.name} (H2 Corp) collects on huerkamphomes.com, how we use and share it, advertising, text messages, and your choices.`}>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy" lede={`Huerkamp Home Group (H2 Corp) · huerkamphomes.com. Last updated: ${updated}.`} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose legal">
      <p>This policy explains what information we collect when you use huerkamphomes.com, how we use it, who we share it with, and the choices you have. In this policy, "we," "us" and "our" mean H2 Corp, doing business as Huerkamp Home Group.</p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you search for homes, request a showing, ask a question, sign up for alerts, request a home valuation, take a quiz, or contact us, we collect what you enter: your name, email address, phone number, the property or area you are interested in, your price range, and any message you write.</p>
      <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you use our website we collect technical and activity information, such as the pages and listings you view, homes you save, searches you run, the date and time, your device and browser type, and your approximate location from your IP address. We collect this using cookies and similar technologies (see section 6).</p>
      <p><strong>Information from others.</strong> If you reach us through a listing portal or another real estate website, that service may send us the contact details and inquiry you submitted.</p>

      <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your requests, schedule showings and provide real estate services.</li>
        <li>To send you listings, saved-search alerts, market updates and follow-ups you asked for, by email, phone, or text message where you have agreed to receive them.</li>
        <li>To understand how our website is used and to improve it.</li>
        <li>To show you advertising for our services (see section 4).</li>
        <li>To keep our systems secure, prevent fraud, and meet legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Who we share information with</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information for money.</p>
      <p>We share information only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service providers who help us run our business under agreements that limit how they use it: our customer relationship management and website providers (for example Follow Up Boss), email and text-messaging providers, analytics providers, and our internal tools that help our agents respond to you quickly.</li>
        <li>Our agents and team members who work with you.</li>
        <li>Advertising platforms, as described in section 4.</li>
        <li>Others when required by law, or to protect our rights or the safety of others, or in connection with a sale or reorganization of our business.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Text message information.</strong> Phone numbers and text-message consent information are not shared with third parties or affiliates for their marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>4. Advertising and audiences</h2>
      <p>We may advertise our services on platforms such as Facebook and Instagram (Meta) and Google. To do this we may:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use advertising pixels and similar tools on our website that tell those platforms when you visit, so we can measure and show relevant ads.</li>
        <li>Upload a list of contact details (email addresses and phone numbers) of people who have contacted us to an advertising platform so we can show ads to them or to similar audiences. Before upload, these details are converted into an encoded, one-way form (a "hash") that the platform matches against its own users. The platform may use this to show our ads and, as its policies allow, to operate its service. Contact details of people who have asked not to be contacted or have unsubscribed are not included.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Real estate ads are limited by law and by platform rules. They do not target or exclude people based on protected characteristics.</p>
      <p><strong>Your choices.</strong> To be removed from our advertising lists, email us at <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. You can also manage ad settings in your Facebook, Instagram and Google accounts, and turn off personalized ads there.</p>

      <h2>5. Text messages</h2>
      <p>If you agree to receive text messages from us, you will receive messages about your inquiry, listings and follow-ups. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop receiving texts at any time, or HELP for help. Agreeing to texts is not required to use our website or to buy or sell a home with us.</p>
      <p>You can also take back your consent to calls and texts in any other reasonable way, such as telling your agent or emailing <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. We honor it as soon as possible and within 10 business days. Details are in our <a href="/sms-terms">SMS terms</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>We and our providers use cookies, pixels and similar tools to keep the site working, remember your preferences and searches, measure traffic and advertising, and recognize you when you return. You can control cookies in your browser settings. If you block them, some features may not work. Some browsers and devices also offer a "Do Not Track" or global privacy control setting; where we are able to detect it, we treat it as an opt-out of advertising uses described in section 4.</p>
      <p>You can also turn off analytics, advertising and home-activity sharing on our <a href="/cookies">Manage cookies</a> page.</p>

      <h2>7. How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>We keep your information for as long as needed to provide our services, meet legal and record-keeping obligations, and resolve disputes. We delete or de-identify it when it is no longer needed.</p>

      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information, including access controls and encryption in transit. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>9. Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to: tell you what personal information we hold about you; correct it; delete it; stop using it for advertising; or stop contacting you. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under your state's privacy law. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. We may need to verify your identity before we act, and we will respond within the time the law requires.</p>

      <h2>10. Children</h2>
      <p>Our website is for adults and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

      <h2>11. Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Our website may link to other sites, such as listing and mortgage sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed. If we make a significant change, we will post a notice on this page.</p>

      <h2>13. Contact us</h2>
      <p>H2 Corp, doing business as Huerkamp Home Group<br />Email: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a><br />Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a><br />14300 Nicollet Court, Suite 208, Burnsville MN 55306</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 48rem; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 2rem; font: 500 1.5rem/1.2 var(--serif); }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
</style>
